```

This implementation tracks objects by their `object_id`, ensuring that identity (not `==`) determines whether an object is already registered. Registering the same object multiple times has no effect after the first time, while distinct objects that are `==` to each other are tracked separately. `#size` and `#to_a` reflect the registration order and count based on this identity tracking.

